    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** Under Offer ** 4 Bedroom Detached Residence on Approx. 0.71 Acres with adjoining double garage. \n\nEnjoying picturesque countryside views, the property offers the perfect balance of tranquil country living while remaining conveniently located just 3km from Knocknagoshel Village, where a range of local amenities including a primary school, church and pubs are available. The bustling market towns of Abbeyfeale and Castleisland, both approximately 9km away, provide a wider selection of shops, schools and everyday services.\n\nThe home benefits from bright south and west-facing living areas, allowing natural light to flood the interior throughout the day. The property has been newly plumbed and features double-glazed windows throughout. Services include a private water supply and on-site septic tank.\n\nA significant additional feature is the detached double garage (approximately 10m x 4.5m) with an adjoining fuel store, providing excellent space for storage, a workshop or a variety of hobby and DIY uses.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Sherry FitzGerald Stack, Sole Selling Agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 2.09m x 2.09m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nEntrance Hallway - 4.35m 1.84m\nwith carpet flooring & velux window\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 4.36m x 3.64m\nwith open fireplace, carpet flooring & 2 windows\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.45m x 4.26m\nsolid oak fitted kitchen, wall & floor tiles, Boru solid fuel stove (with back boiler) & 3 windows\n\nUtility Room - 2.39m x 2.0\nplumbed for washing machine, fitted units, floor tiles, window and glazed door to rear\n\nAiring Cupboard - 1m x 1m\nshelved\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.94m x 3.05m\ndouble with carpet flooring & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.80m x 3.04m\ndouble with carpet flooring & window\n\nShower Room - 2.41m x 1.79m\nshower, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\n1st Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 4.26m x 2.59m\nwith carpet flooring, 2 velux\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.24m x 3.63m\ndouble with carpet flooring & 2 windows\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.80m x 2.33m\ndouble / twin room with carpet flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 3.03m x 1.83m\nwith bath, whb, w/c & window\n\nAttic - 9.55m x 4.43m\npartially converted and floored with velux windows fitted (access directly via landing)\n\nDouble Garage - 10m x 4.5m\nwith attached store\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4 bedroom, 2 bathroom detached residence set on a generous 0.71-acre site </li><li>Scenic countryside location</li><li>3km from the village of Knocknagoshel and local </li><li>9km to the market towns of Abbeyfeale and Castleisland </li><li>South and west-facing living areas</li><li>The property has been newly plumbed</li><li>Double-glazed windows throughout</li><li>Private water supply and on-site septic tank.</li><li>Detached double garage (approximately 10m x 4.5m) with an adjoining fuel store, offering excellent space for storage, workshop or DIY purposes.</ul>"
      },
